{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sf603bf5b3fe20590","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-9518e10d68e1aaa22bbb","text":"我也是豹，我是迷糊姐姐的圣兽…难道我看起来不像吗？","speaker":"圣兽蝶"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a88e7dbd6a2876ac375d","text":"我、我只是穿上了黄金款皮肤而已，这是我抽奖抽出来的——我可不是在晒嗡！","speaker":"圣兽蝶"}]}
